OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy cloud 
OL,6,Fdevelops through the evening, with     
OL,7,Fisolated showers moving inland from    
OL,8,Fthe coast and across the Cheviots.     
OL,9,FTurning cold and frosty where skies    
OL,10,Fremain clear. Becoming a little        
OL,11,Fbreezier along the coast and hills by  
OL,12,Fmorning.                               
OL,14,CSunday:FA partly cloudy day with the   
OL,15,Fodd shower possible, mainly on the     
OL,16,Fcoasts. Remaining cold inland and      
OL,17,Fbreezier than Saturday.                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
