OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with isolated showers on        
OL,7,FMonday. Turning cloudier through       
OL,8,FTuesday with strengthening winds and   
OL,9,Frain arriving later. Cloudy and breezy 
OL,10,Fon Wednesday. Temperatures slowly      
OL,11,Frecovering through the period.         
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
